# Lessons — {{TITLE}}

Promoted lessons from the Learning Loop. Each lesson cites evidence and is git-versioned.

**Promotion gate:** A candidate lesson reaches this file only via Carson's explicit approval OR after appearing in 3+ consistent reflections. No silent promotion.

**Structure:** Lessons are structured, not prose. Enables deduplication and contradiction-checking.

